A user clicks tab "2", then tab "3" quickly. Both updates use the same `startTransition` from `useTransition`, and each tab suspends on its own data. Tab 2's data arrives first. What is on screen at that moment?

```jsx
const [isPending, startTransition] = useTransition();
const select = (t) => startTransition(() => setTab(t));
// tab 1 is shown; select('2'); select('3');
```

